// GraphQL 请求体示例：`graphql { ... }` 块会自动转换为 JSON（{"query": ..., "variables": ...}）
// 并自动补 Content-Type: application/json

### 查询（无变量）
POST https://countries.trevithick.me/graphql

graphql
query {
  countries(filter: { code: { in: ["CN", "US", "JP"] } }) {
    code
    name
  }
}

### 带变量的查询
POST https://countries.trevithick.me/graphql

graphql {
  query getCountry($code: ID!) {
    country(code: $code) {
      code
      name
      capital
    }
  }
  variables {
    "code": "CN"
  }
}

> {%
    client.test("GraphQL 返回国家", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.errors === undefined, "GraphQL 错误: " + JSON.stringify(response.body.errors));
    });
%}
